        {
          "text": "Ɛn cäŋ ɛmɔ bi Kuäär ni Kuoth rɔ nyɔk kɛ mi no̱o̱ŋɛ duɔth nɛɛnikɛ tin ŋot kɛ tëk kä A-thi-ri-ya kɛnɛ cam I-jëp kɛ cuec I-jëp kɛ Kuc kɛnɛ Ee-lam kɛ Ci-nar kɛnɛ Ä-math kɛ dhuɔ̱li baar.",
